  <item>
    <title>EP15 | 入住新家两个月，我有23件软装家电想安利你</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6476052d16726282407ae781</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6476052d16726282407ae781</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 30 May 2023 14:16:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎光临发财大吉家🏠之前的节目里我们详细介绍了硬装及踩坑的部分，这次终于来到家电和软装部分。</span></p><span></span><p><span>距离我们正式入伙已经两个多月，这段时间发财待在家里的时间变多了，认真感受了这个家的每一个可爱的地方。趁着年中大促来临前，想将我们用过、觉得好的23件产品推荐给计划装修/正在施工/准备入住/享受生活的大家，也欢迎大家在评论区向我们卖安利。</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Ps.本期节目绿色无广，节目中会提及选购的品牌和购买渠道，如果有更优秀的品牌或者更价优的渠道欢迎告诉大家呀～</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📖SHOWNOTES：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">1:10</a> 带你天天疯狂星期四的空气炸锅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="286">4:46</a> 性价比超高的洗洁精自动出液机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="483">8:03</a> “企企理理”日式米桶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="553">9:13</a> 保洁好物静电贴和防水胶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="704">11:44</a> 不伤墙的免钉吸盘挂钩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="815">13:35</a> 依然不伤墙的子母扣上墙置物架</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1043">17:23</a> 爆水管时少不了橡胶水刮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1119">18:39</a> 爱马X屋顶花园平替香氛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1313">21:53</a> “真香”的智能马桶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1570">26:10</a> 吸力超强硅藻泥地垫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1671">27:51</a> 扎实貌美的樱桃木千寻床</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1808">30:08</a> 宽容度极高的亚朵床垫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2000">33:20</a> 滑捋捋凉浸浸unisleep凉皮枕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2164">36:04</a> 一年可以用三季的明治西川春秋被</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2330">38:50</a> 用床笠不要用床单</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2457">40:57</a> 全屋唯一非实木家具：樱桃木贴皮镜子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2544">42:24</a> 发掘空气净化器的非典型功能</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2685">44:45</a> 单手能够抽起来的樱桃木靓靓吧椅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2781">46:21</a> 可以联通苹果全家桶的apple TV</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2919">48:39</a> 还算聪明的智能家电组合</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2990">49:50</a> 好用好玩的德龙咖啡玩具机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3052">50:52</a> 不喝水只喝泰象气泡水</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3227">53:47</a> 厚到可以拿来擦地的unifree洗面巾</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵MUSIC：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《F.M.L》-seventeen</span></p><span></span><p><span>《April shower》-seventeen</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>☎️如果你想和我们深入交流，欢迎在以下平台找到我们：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>·节目同步更新：小宇宙 / QQ音乐 / apple podcast</span></p><span></span><p><span>·即刻 / 红薯：@黄大吉</span></p><span></span><p><span>·听众群+V：erek916</span></p>]]></description>
