  <item>
    <title>EP14 | 看过许多踩坑视频，依然装不好这个修</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/645896957d934b8505e78cc3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">645896957d934b8505e78cc3</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 08 May 2023 06:28:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎光临发财大吉家～关于我们家的踩坑视频，已经在🍠@黄大吉 里分享过，篇幅原因，还是想在播客做一期踩坑吐槽节目。欢迎去🍠先看一次视频到底有多离谱，再过来听暴躁版hometour。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/liGIJ3pCBXScLiZEh2taHGxWm9Fa.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📖SHOWNOTES：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">1:55</a> 窗户前有遮挡物，影响短手开关窗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="355">5:55</a> 客厅和阳台只有一个开启位，夏天好闷热</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="582">9:42</a> 香格里拉帘藏飞虫且难打扫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="761">12:41</a> 两个窗帘盒挨得太近，一开关就打架</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="872">14:32</a> 窗帘盒没位置装，只好去除纱窗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="971">16:11</a> 鞋柜深度不足，一层只能摆一双鞋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1109">18:29</a> 定制柜小格多、大格少，难收纳大件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1292">21:32</a> 娇气实木地板让南方人很焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1647">27:27</a> 电位没按生活习惯来连</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1728">28:48</a> 抽油烟机上方柜门得用抠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1823">30:23</a> 厨房动线没设计好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1946">32:26</a> 洗脸盆深度不够，水花四溅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2078">34:38</a> 墙出水龙头未来隐患很大</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2123">35:23</a> 水纹玻璃加油砂，浴室门还是透</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2262">37:42</a> 浴室砌壁龛不符合经济原则</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2376">39:36</a> 长地漏超难用且令人费解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2541">42:21</a> 榻榻米旁的衣柜只能横着走</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2740">45:40</a> 地台榻榻米搞卫生好废人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2910">48:30</a> 不推荐定制柜用反弹器</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3087">51:27</a> 空调洞要打出斜度避免进水</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3150">52:30</a> 家电的位置和尺寸要预留好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3306">55:06</a> 封闭阳台失去了主妇最爱晾晒空间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3349">55:49</a> 因为“层高不足”而被迫放弃了浴霸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3415">56:55</a> “每个业主都是自己家的第一责任人”，千错万错都是自己的错</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵MUSIC：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《小林不动产》-林家谦</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>☎️如果你想和我们深入交流，欢迎在以下平台找到我们：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>·节目同步更新：小宇宙 / QQ音乐 / apple podcast</span></p><span></span><p><span>·即刻 / 红薯：@黄大吉</span></p><span></span><p><span>·听众群+V：erek916</span></p>]]></description>
