    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>上次给泰版《流星花园》的爱情线留了个坑，这次要来填坑啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📖SHOWNOTES：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="16">0:16</a> &nbsp;先戴头盔：大家务必分清少女漫和现实生活界限，遇到校霸道明寺记得掉头就跑！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">1:55</a> &nbsp;以往的道明寺像一个符号，泰版道明寺更像一个“人”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="359">5:59</a> &nbsp;泰版道明寺高光时刻：如果道歉有用的话，下跪来干嘛啦？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="606">10:06</a> Gorya vs Lita vs Thyme：如果先遇到未婚妻，结局会不会不一样？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="962">16:02</a> Gorya vs Thyme vs Ren：异性恋告白天花板，司菜党看到15集花泽类都准备爬墙了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1117">18:37</a> 编剧好狠，给花泽类和观众投喂含剧毒的糖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1202">20:02</a> 爱情没有如果，杉菜也没有斯德哥尔摩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1322">22:02</a> &nbsp;剪刀手圆梦花菜党，让花菜在漫画场景背后谈一场不失联的爱</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔗上集：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1qR4y1F7Bh?spm_id_from=333.999.0.0" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1qR4y1F7Bh?spm_id_from=333.999.0.0"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>🔗下集：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV14Y4y1H77i?spm_id_from=333.999.0.0" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV14Y4y1H77i?spm_id_from=333.999.0.0"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>☎️如果你想和我们深入交流，欢迎在以下平台找到我们：</span></p><span></span><p><span>·节目同步更新：小宇宙 / QQ音乐 / apple podcast</span></p><span></span><p><span>·即刻 / 红薯：@黄大吉</span></p><span></span><p><span>·听众群+V：erek916</span></p>]]></description>
