  <item>
    <title>EP7 | 男人至死是少年，女人至死看流星花園</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6240f4cde05fe074ad81d15a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6240f4cde05fe074ad81d15a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 27 Mar 2022 23:30:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近发财和大吉都系度追泰版《流星花园》，上头又顶瘾，到底泰版同之前各个版本有咩唔同呢？呢集就简单讲下！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📖SHOWNOTES：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="78">1:18</a></span></strong><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;大吉点解入坑“泰版流星花园”？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">2:30</a></span></strong><span> &nbsp;泰版改编：让偶像剧的外表，加上了社会议题的内核</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="250">4:10</a></span></strong><span> &nbsp;10几年前“霸道总裁爱上你”情节母题背后，隐藏着对霸凌行为的漠视</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="370">6:10</a></span></strong><span> &nbsp;台版“流星花园”增加了喜剧的元素来营造笑点，极大程度的削弱了校园霸凌的惊心动魄</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">9:00</a></span></strong><span> &nbsp;道明寺为何要玩“红牌游戏”，霸凌者其实也是被霸凌者</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="815">13:35</a></span></strong><span> 泰版增加了互联网设定，运用社媒植入到情节中，更切合时代潮流</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1030">17:10</a></span></strong><span> 泰版深化了花泽类的成长线，并探讨了和藤堂静爱情的可能性</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a></span></strong><span> gorya（泰杉菜）长得太可爱了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>☎️如果你想和我们深入交流，欢迎在以下平台找到我们：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>·节目同步更新：小宇宙 / QQ音乐 / apple podcast</span></p><span></span><p><span>·即刻 / 红薯：@黄大吉</span></p><span></span><p><span>·听众群+V：erek916</span></p>]]></description>
