  <item>
    <title>EP6 | Let&apos;s be “on 膠”！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61f3712641060bffd210c1f9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">61f3712641060bffd210c1f9</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 28 Jan 2022 04:23:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Ep3讲香港综艺的时候，曾经简单讲到几档比较喜欢的ViuTV节目，这次同大家讲下发财和大吉都非常沉迷的《胶戰》。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📖SHOWNOTES：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="146">2:26</a> &nbsp;什么是“胶”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">5:40</a> “最重要的是人”，隆重介绍胶战“6胶”</span></p><span></span><p><span>·「索女」Hillary刘沛蘅：花花生成器</span></p><span></span><p><span>·「靓仔」Jeffrey魏浚笙：中二病男神</span></p><span></span><p><span>·「麻甩」黄正宜阿正：四次元花痴</span></p><span></span><p><span>·「偶像派」Edan吕爵安：无包袱偶像、连环不幸黑气石</span></p><span></span><p><span>·「弱鸡」岑迦其：爷爷易怒长气又惊死</span></p><span></span><p><span>·「肥仔」肥肠：一个认真肥仔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1182">19:42</a> 最中意的胶人：大吉肤浅爱靓仔，发财最爱聪明正</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1433">23:53</a> 有创意、放胆做，低成本游戏都可以笑爆肚</span></p><span></span><p><span>·「输鼠恕薯树」</span></p><span></span><p><span>·「噢圣诞节唱乜东东」</span></p><span></span><p><span>·「有只雀仔跌落水」</span></p><span></span><p><span>·「疯狂接线生」</span></p><span></span><p><span>·「女上司背后曳曳」</span></p><span></span><p><span>·「连灯仔都熄埋」</span></p><span></span><p><span>·「糊涂脚趾」</span></p><span></span><p><span>·「脚趾拗出唔拗入」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1884">31:24</a> 制作及其认真精良，鲁生麻烦加制作组人工～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2213">36:53</a> 隐藏7、8胶：NPC Albert、烂GAG主持阿Max</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2358">39:18</a> 《胶战》所带来的单纯快乐是时代必需品</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>☎️如果你想和我们深入交流，欢迎在以下平台找到我们：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>·节目同步更新：小宇宙 / QQ音乐 / apple podcast</span></p><span></span><p><span>·即刻 / 红薯：@黄大吉</span></p><span></span><p><span>·听众群+V：erek916</span></p>]]></description>
