  <item>
    <title>EP5 | 港一港，我最喜愛2021年度十大粵語歌</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61c9e1aaf97e12e3059c15ee</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">61c9e1aaf97e12e3059c15ee</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 27 Dec 2021 15:47:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在叱咤903颁奖典礼开奖之前，干脆来聊一期超私心《2021年度叱咤回声粤语歌颁奖典礼》。你嘅十大年度粤语歌又系咩咧？不如评论讲比我哋听！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📖SHOWNOTES：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>· Part1 我们心目中的2021十大粤语歌曲</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">3:00</a> 《E先生连环不幸事件》- Edan吕爵安</span></p><span></span><p><span>Wyman黄伟文为其量身定做三部曲，其中最爱《E先生》，独奏的Edan识发光。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="531">8:51</a> 《我不如》- Mike曾比特</span></p><span></span><p><span>“我不如过街老鼠”、“我不如野生箭猪”，林若宁的词超加分。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 《How Many Times》（反对无效英文版）-MC张天赋&amp;冯允谦</span></p><span></span><p><span>中文版《反对无效》已经几中意，同冯允谦合作英文版更加喜欢，两人声线缠绵悱恻、水乳交融。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 《Dear my friend，》- 姜涛</span></p><span></span><p><span>以前成日弹姜涛唱甜歌，从《孤独病》同《Dear my friend，》起开始改观。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1419">23:39</a> 《凡星》- 陈蕾</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈蕾一路走来都和故事里面女主角一样，试过变卖家当维持生计，但仍深信“只要有找对地方，大家都可以尽情发光”。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1690">28:10</a> 《人类不宜飞行》 - DEAR JANE</span></p><span></span><p><span>最怕band佬唱情歌，DJ式年度苦情大作，听一次起鸡皮一次。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1937">32:17</a> 《係咁先喇》- MC $oHo &amp; KidNey (feat. Kayan9896)</span></p><span></span><p><span>《试当真》的音乐延伸，戏谑形式蹭热点，大胆！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2345">39:05</a> 《先哭为敬》- 郑欣宜</span></p><span></span><p><span>欣宜完成了从女神到天后的蜕变。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2622">43:42</a> 《情歌之后》- 许靖韵</span></p><span></span><p><span>几中意哩首歌巧思，係after情歌？queen of 情歌？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2790">46:30</a> 《东京人寿》- 容祖儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>两位前辈压轴。容祖儿在《浪姐2》哩捍卫港派“樽盐”。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3168">52:48</a> 《俏郎君》- 张敬轩</span></p><span></span><p><span>轩公大战四镜神，皇上果然系皇上，想表达咩就表达咩～</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>·Part2 &nbsp;不负责任的叱咤乐坛奖项猜测</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3358">55:58</a></span></strong><span> 不负责任的叱咤乐坛奖项猜测，买定离手！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>☎️如果你想和我们深入交流，欢迎在以下平台找到我们：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>·节目同步更新：小宇宙 / QQ音乐 / apple podcast</span></p><span></span><p><span>·即刻 / 红薯：@黄大吉</span></p><span></span><p><span>·听众群+V：erek916</span></p>]]></description>
